      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Very clear – a simple, phone-free solution for better sleep. The ‘no apps, no phones’ message is compelling.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Large – addresses a widespread problem (sleep disruption due to phone use) with a significant potential market.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Strong – Shows a completed mass-production run and a clear timeline. The beta-tester testimonials add credibility.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Solid – A straightforward product with a clear value proposition and a reasonable pricing strategy. No subscriptions.",
